<title>MALAYSIA: Pacific Bank 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Pacific Bank 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  84.48   vs	  39.65</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 25.0    vs	  16.0</p>
<p>    Operating revenue	681.01   vs	 363.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   139.95   vs	  67.08</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   0.87   vs  less   0.62</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  3.5    vs	   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Pacific Bank Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
